<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woodside Dec qtr sales total A$189 m.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woodside Dec qtr sales total A$189 m.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodside Petroleum Ltd said on Thursday its sales revenue totalled A$188.6 million in the three months ended December 31.  </p>
<p>Sales in the 1995 December quarter were A$168.3 million.</p>
<p>Woodside, 40 percent owned by Royal Dutch/Shell Group , said its capital expenditure during the December quarter was A$20.0 million and its exploration expenditure was A$8.2 million.</p>
<p>Woodside is the operator fo the North West Shelf gas project offshore Western Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
